  "releaseNotes": "📦 VDocs – Release Notes\n\t\t🚀 Version: 2026.8.1\n\n\t\t═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\t\t📄 PDF Import and Enhanced File Handling\n\n\t\tWe are excited to announce a major update to VDocs with the initial implementation of PDF file reading and significant improvements to the document loading and saving API. This release introduces a cleaner, more intuitive API for working with documents across multiple formats.\n\n\t\t═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n\t\t🎯 Summary\n\t\tThis release focuses on expanding VDocs' file handling capabilities with:\n\n\t\t✅ Initial PDF import support – Read and parse PDF documents into the VDocs DOM\n\n\t\t✅ Unified file opening API – Consistent static factory methods for all formats\n\n\t\t✅ Simplified save API – Clear, format-specific save methods\n\n\t\t✅ Enhanced XML documentation – Comprehensive usage examples for all new APIs\n\n\t\t✅ Improved API consistency – Better naming and organization",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "VDocs - Word & PDF & HTML Document Framework",
